.SH NAME
frontend/node_modules/shebang-command Directory Reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "shebang-command [![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/kevva/shebang-command.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/kevva/shebang-command)"
.PP
.RS 4
Get the command from a shebang 
.RE
.PP
.SH "Install"
.PP
.PP
.nf
$ npm install shebang\-command
.fi
.PP
.SH "Usage"
.PP
.PP
.nf
const shebangCommand = require('shebang\-command');

shebangCommand('#!/usr/bin/env node');
//=> 'node'

shebangCommand('#!/bin/bash');
//=> 'bash'
.fi
.PP
.SH "API"
.PP
.SS "shebangCommand(string)"
.SS "string"
Type: \fRstring\fP

.PP
String containing a shebang\&. 
